<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product</p>
<p>(Guernsey) Ltd  has issued a total of 200,000 European-style</p>
<p>corridor warrants, on the CAC 40 index, lead manager Credit</p>
<p>Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     186.00 FRF		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	14.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
